            "frametrail:type": "text",
            "format": "text/html",
            "value": "",
            "frametrail:name": "Six years of warnings",
            "frametrail:attributes": {
                "text": "&lt;div class=&quot;dossierNote&quot; data-layer=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;dossierLayer&quot;&gt;Sources&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;dossierTitle&quot;&gt;Six years of warnings&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ammonium nitrate was unloaded into this hangar in October 2014. Port and customs officials warned of the danger from December of that year. In February 2015 an expert commissioned by the Lebanese courts found 70 per cent of the sacks torn open. The chronology shown is by Legal Action Worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
            }
        }
    },
